</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When the soft dews of kindly sleep</l><l>My wearied eyelids gently steep,</l><l>Be my last thought how sweet to rest</l><l>Forever on my Savior’s breast.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Abide with me from morn till eve,</l><l>For without Thee I cannot live;</l><l>Abide with me when night is nigh,</l><l>For without Thee I dare not die.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Come near, and bless us when we wake,</l><l>Ere through the world our way we take;</l><l>Till in the ocean of Thy love</l><l>We lose ourselves in Thee above.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
